@startuml
actor Caller
participant ProviderComposition as Composition
participant ObservationHub as Hub
participant LoopbackProvider as Provider
participant SyntheticObservationSink as Sink
Caller -> Hub: attach(filter, payload policy, overflow policy)
Hub --> Caller: exact TapHandle
Caller -> Composition: submit(provider route handle, item)
Composition -> Composition: authenticate lifecycle and item
Composition -> Hub: reserve matching lossless capacity
alt lossless capacity unavailable
Hub --> Composition: observation-backpressure + degraded validity
Composition --> Caller: reject before provider mutation
else capacity available or best effort
Composition -> Provider: submit exact item
Provider --> Composition: provider outcome
Composition -> Hub: publish normalized record and counters
Hub --> Composition: bounded publish result
Composition --> Caller: provider outcome
end
Sink -> Hub: poll(TapHandle)
Hub --> Sink: owned record or empty
Sink -> Hub: snapshot/acknowledge/detach(TapHandle)
@enduml
